  "title": "Iranian President Pezeshkian Criticizes Western Sanctions on BRICS and Global Food Security",
  "summary": "Iranian President Masoud Pezeshkian slammed Western economic sanctions on BRICS and global food security, calling for a more inclusive international order and expanding BRICS's role in economic cooperation. He emphasized that the sanctions negatively impact global welfare and food security, urging BRICS to act more effectively.",
